	(text "- U3 AMD SVI3 3-rail digital controller: Renesas RAA229139 (X+Y+Z <= 8) or MPS MP2857 / uPI uP9533P; RAA229621 / XDPE192C3B = 2 rails + separate MISC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.20 35.56 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "7b3c764a-d403-4ca7-b5cb-d2892ac29d9e")
	)
	(text "- Q1-Q5 + L1-L5: VDDCR 5 phases | Q6-Q7 + L6-L7: VDDCR_SOC 2 phases | Q8 + L8: VDD_MISC 1 phase (SVI3 Type II rail)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.20 39.37 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6f86179c-cd70-4f5b-9aaa-887e46084957")
	)
	(text "- SiC654 50 A smart power stages (MLP55-31L 5x5) + Eaton FP4 0.15 uH (5.0 mm) - same parts and column as the LGA1700 CB"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.20 43.18 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "6b5c57e1-c0f6-4a2e-b834-acf482002867")
	)
	(text "- Load line, IccMax/TDC/EDC from the AMD AM5 VR design guide (NDA); v3 65 W class = TDC 75 A / EDC 150 A (AM5 socket limits for 65 W) -> VRM re-check vs the 45 W v1 sizing"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.20 46.99 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
		(uuid "5b7eb38a-aeb4-46fa-9458-4076818ad88d")
	)
	(text "- VR_HOT_L wired into PROCHOT_L; PMBus to the EC for telemetry (optional)"
